Darkwood AI extends Symfony AI. It does not replace or fork that project.

Monorepo tooling in this repository (Composer workspace scripts, PHPStan rules,
PHP-CS-Fixer configuration, Deptrac layout and CI helpers) is adapted from
https://github.com/symfony/ai.

Symfony AI Platform remains an external Composer dependency
(`symfony/ai-platform`). Darkwood AI does not ship a duplicate Platform package.

Adapted Symfony files keep their original copyright notices.
